@api = https://localhost:7198
@authserver = https://localhost:7155
@username = demo@local
@password = Demo123!
@admin_client_id = opentenid-admin-portal
@admin_client_secret = opentenid-admin-portal-secret
@tenant_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1) Gerar token no AuthServer (copie access_token para @token abaixo)
POST {{authserver}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username={{username}}&password={{password}}&client_id={{admin_client_id}}&client_secret={{admin_client_secret}}&scope=api

### cole o access_token retornado aqui
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 2) Opcional: descobrir tenant interno no AuthServer e copiar para @tenant_id
GET {{authserver}}/tenants/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Validar HasPermission("tenants.read") na API de negócio
GET {{api}}/tenant/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant_id}}
